ich continues from CHV-10-1 downstream of P-10-2 (PL-41); P-10-2 is fed from P-10-1 (PG-40), which is fed from E-10-1 (PL-39); E-10-1 is fed via the PL-85 line from BV-7-1, which is downstream of CHV-7-1 on the E-7-1 outlet (PG-27). The valves in this upstream path are CHV-7-1, BV-7-1, CHV-10-1, CHV-10-2 and CHV-10-3. (Note: there is no valve between P-16-1 and P-16-2, so P-16-1 itself cannot be valve-isolated from P-16-2.)"}}}
