{"qid": "b04", "family": "b", "split": "dev", "method": "M3", "model": "glm", "answer": {"method": "M3", "model": "glm", "final": {"answer": "GV-1-4 is drawn as a globe valve on the P&ID, and the matching vendor datasheet (gfps-165-solenoid-valve) describes it as a Type 165 2/2-way solenoid valve, so yes, it needs electrical power to operate. The datasheet lists available supply voltages of 24V DC, 230V 50/60Hz AC, and 115V 50/60Hz AC (voltage tolerance ±10%), so both 24V DC and 230V AC are supported variants of this valve. However, neither the P&ID nor the datasheet excerpt states which voltage variant GV-1-4 specifically is, so the documents do not say whether 24V DC or 230V AC is required for this particular installation.", "not_present": false}, "outcome": "ANSWERED", "route": ["context_rag+chunks"], "cypher": [], "sources": [{"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "pages": [36]}, {"document_id": "gfps-165-solenoid-valve", "pages": [6, 2, 5, 4, 1, 3]}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "pages": [47, 87, 36, 32, 16]}], "latency_s": 3.320380999997724, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 57359, "completion_tokens": 418, "cost_usd": 0.00180828, "spent_usd": 0.00180828, "n_calls": 2, "n_cached": 0, "models": ["qwen/qwen3-embedding-8b", "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash"]}, "trace": {"chunks": [{"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 36, "score": 0.6175}, {"document_id": "gfps-165-solenoid-valve", "page": 6, "score": 0.6054}, {"document_id": "gfps-165-solenoid-valve", "page": 2, "score": 0.5798}, {"document_id": "gfps-165-solenoid-valve", "page": 5, "score": 0.5657}, {"document_id": "gfps-165-solenoid-valve", "page": 4, "score": 0.5641}, {"document_id": "gfps-165-solenoid-valve", "page": 1, "score": 0.5627}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 47, "score": 0.5616}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 87, "score": 0.5585}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 36, "score": 0.5539}, {"document_id": "rose