{"qid": "c04", "family": "c", "split": "dev", "method": "M3", "model": "glm", "answer": {"method": "M3", "model": "glm", "final": {"answer": "The valve operated by loop FIC-15-3 is FV-15-3, a Fisher ET globe-style control valve (fisher-et-d100022x012). Per that datasheet, the trim options for ET valves are the standard trims (1, 4, 27, 29, 37, 37H, 57, and, for NACE sour service, 85, 86, 87), the Trim Cartridge variants (1TC, 27TC, 29TC, 85TC, 87TC), Cavitrol III one- and two-stage cages, and the noise-attenuating cages Whisper Trim I, Whisper Trim III, Whisper NXG and WhisperFlo. For high pressure drop, the Cavitrol III cages are offered (with their pressure-drop limits given in Figures 13-15), and for aerodynamic noise attenuation the Whisper Trim III, Whisper NXG and WhisperFlo cages are offered. The datasheet excerpts do not state which specific trim is actually fitted to FV-15-3, so that part is not stated.", "not_present": false}, "outcome": "ANSWERED", "route": ["context_rag+chunks"], "cypher": [], "sources": [{"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "pages": [18, 26, 6, 3, 7, 9, 19, 2, 32, 25, 22, 16]}], "latency_s": 4.989298800006509, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 60403, "completion_tokens": 796, "cost_usd": 0.0023504100000000003, "spent_usd": 0.0023504100000000003, "n_calls": 2, "n_cached": 0, "models": ["qwen/qwen3-embedding-8b", "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash"]}, "trace": {"chunks": [{"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 18, "score": 0.6724}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 26, "score": 0.6391}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 6, "score": 0.6301}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 3, "score": 0.6215}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 7, "score": 0.6034}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 9, "score": 0.5996}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 19, "score": 0.5972}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 2, "score": 0.5965}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d1000